BTW Bonus: Nested loops
BTW Expected output:
BTW 0,0
BTW 0,1
BTW 1,0
BTW 1,1

HAI
    WAZZUP
        I HAS A i ITZ 0
        I HAS A j ITZ 0
    BUHBYE

    IM IN YR outer UPPIN YR i TIL BOTH SAEM i AN 2
        j R 0
        IM IN YR inner UPPIN YR j TIL BOTH SAEM j AN 2
            VISIBLE i + "," + j
        IM OUTTA YR inner
    IM OUTTA YR outer
KTHXBYE
